{
  "ALL_TEXT": "39 EXT. AUDITORIUM ROAD - DAY \nTwo constables walk up from a series of parked bikes, and \nreach the middle of the road to stop two bikers. \nCONSTABLE 1 \nLicense undaa \nCONSTABLE 1 takes the bike's keys away. \nDRIVER 1 \nSir naa daggara anni documents \nunnaayi sir. Office ki late aiythe \nboss tidtaadu sir. \nCONSTABLE 1 \nLeave pettu \nDRIVER 1 \nAla chesta nanna kodtaadu sir \nCONSTABLE 1 \noka saari phone ivvu \nDRIVER 1 is reluctant. CONSTABLE 1 grabs the phone \nCONSTABLE 1 \norei, veedi office ki phone chesi \nveella nanna hospital lo unnadu ani \ncheppu \nDRIVER 1 \nMari maa nannaki \nCONSTABLE 1 \naa adi okati undi kadaa...veella \nintiki phone chesi veella boss \nhospital lo unnaadu ee roju leave \nani cheppu \nDRIVER 1 \nMari iddaru hospital lo okkalaki \nokkaru edurai nenu dorikipothe? \nCONSTABLE 1 \nSoftware ae kadaa....I know my dal \nrice kid...nuvvu ee question \nadugutaavu ani naaku telusu... \nCONSTABLE 2 grabs a hold of the DRIVER 2 \nCONSTABLE 2 \nSaar veedu paaripotunnaadu \nCONSTABLE 1 \nOrei, enti raa nee problem? Free \ngaa show chupistunte...musukoni aa \nauditorium looki vellu...oka goppa \nkalakaarudi oka patrabhineyam \nchudachu \nDRIVER 2 \nSir, naaku aina gurinchi telusu \nsir, meeru free gaa show \nchupistaaru kaani naaku aa \ntaravaata hospital bill \npeelipotundi sir...please sir nannu \nvadileyandi sir... \nCONSTABLE 2 \nHum kisi ko nahin chodenge...ae \nraa, Hindi correct ae naa... \nCONSTABLE 1 \nMeaning convey ayyindi le...teesuko \nvelandi, teesuko velandi... \nCONSTABLE 2 \nRandi, manam tea taagi eldam. \nAllam? Lemon? \nHe takes the two sods along with him. Meanwhile, a higher \nofficer, the COMMISSIONER, a barrel-chested, stern, grizzled \nman in his 50s, walks up to CONSTABLE 1. \nCOMMISSIONER \nEnti, endukayya inni bandlu road \nmeeda aaparu, enti problem? \nCONSTABLE 1 \nadi...adi... \nCOMMISSIONER \nCheppavaa? Suspend cheyyalantaava? \nCONSTABLE 1 \nInspector SUBBA RAJU gaari solo \nperformance sir. \nCUT TO:",
